Source: perceptshift
Section: science
Priority: optional
Maintainer: PerceptShift Maintainers <maintainers@perceptshift.local>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, ninja-build, g++, libssl-dev, pkg-config, python3, dh-python
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/perceptshift/perceptshift
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: perceptshift-core
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: PerceptShift core inference library and workers
 Shared library and worker binaries for deadline-aware ONNX Runtime
 inference. Does not bundle models or datasets.

Package: perceptshift-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, perceptshift-core (>= ${source:Version})
Description: PerceptShift operator CLI
 Command-line interface for host inspection, forge orchestration,
 bundle verification, and doctor diagnostics.

Package: perceptshift-ros
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, perceptshift-core (>= ${source:Version}), ros-jazzy-rclcpp
Description: PerceptShift ROS 2 Jazzy packages
 Message interfaces, lifecycle component, and bringup launch files.
 Requires a user-supplied profile bundle at runtime.

Package: perceptshift-api
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, perceptshift-core (>= ${source:Version})
Description: PerceptShift local operational API
 Loopback-default HTTP API for artifacts, health, and authenticated mutations.

Package: perceptshift-console
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: PerceptShift operational console static assets
 Web console presentation assets served locally. No models or datasets included.
